WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
ONE.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
MORE.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.250
PRICE.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.500
COST.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.000
PROFIT.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Every decision has a curve.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.500
How fast? Average rate of change.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.000
The local rate: derivative.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
How much? Accumulated total: integral.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Calculus: change + accumulation.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Higher Mathematics: Calculus for Economics and Business.
When does one more stop being worth it?
